    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home has been sucked into the <strong>sky</strong> for some reason, ascend a <strong>tower of broken cityscape</strong> to get back. Watch out for the various <strong>obstacles</strong> that stand before you, and <strong>try not fall...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Hop to it!' is a <strong>Foddian-style 3D platformer</strong> where you play as a sentient <strong>pogo-stick</strong>, get to the top to return to your <strong>beloved home</strong> that may or may not be a garden shed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.poster.avif?t=1755081238\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.webm?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.mp4?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Groundbreaking sentient <strong>pogo stick physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Serene city views</strong> as you plummet to the ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Helpful tips</strong> to let you know what you could <strong>improve</strong> on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Challenging</strong> but <strong>rewarding movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several <strong>areas</strong> with <strong>unique challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Checkpoint mode</strong> for practice</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop (and fall) through various environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.poster.avif?t=1755081238\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.webm?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.mp4?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home has been sucked into the <strong>sky</strong> for some reason, ascend a <strong>tower of broken cityscape</strong> to get back. Watch out for the various <strong>obstacles</strong> that stand before you, and <strong>try not fall...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Hop to it!' is a <strong>Foddian-style 3D platformer</strong> where you play as a sentient <strong>pogo-stick</strong>, get to the top to return to your <strong>beloved home</strong> that may or may not be a garden shed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.poster.avif?t=1755081238\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.webm?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/3d1fc64201235d32d5024631b4a3ee76.mp4?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Groundbreaking sentient <strong>pogo stick physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Serene city views</strong> as you plummet to the ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Helpful tips</strong> to let you know what you could <strong>improve</strong> on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Challenging</strong> but <strong>rewarding movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Several <strong>areas</strong> with <strong>unique challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Checkpoint mode</strong> for practice</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hop (and fall) through various environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.poster.avif?t=1755081238\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.webm?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684340/extras/22c689b51a6a0c8ba343936bb26f2a7b.mp4?t=1755081238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
